{"content_hash": "1e9a1ae11cd8933d", "version_id": 841, "article_id": 85, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Saudi Aramco buys 49% of AI company HUMAIN", "title_zh": "沙特阿美买下AI公司HUMAIN 49%的股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/020/863.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580163059128-129fad4b73fb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8aHVtYWlufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM1ODExNDh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by tangi bertin on Unsplash", "author": "tangi bertin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@tangib?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/2-people-walking-on-pathway-between-bare-trees-during-foggy-weather-reLB6gIk7to?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(140, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(178, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "3d04ad25edfd"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-02", "word_count": 63, "reading_minutes": 0.3, "lead": "Saudi Aramco is a very big oil company. Now it also wants a big part of an AI company. On November 1, it said it will buy 49% of HUMAIN.", "lead_zh": "沙特阿美是一家很大的石油公司。现在它也想要一家人工智能公司的大部分股份。11月1日，它表示将买下HUMAIN 49%的股份。", "preview": "HUMAIN is an AI company in Saudi Arabia. Before the deal, a Saudi fund called PIF owned all of it. Now PIF keeps 51%.", "preview_zh": "HUMAIN是沙特阿拉伯的一家人工智能公司。在这笔交易之前，沙特基金PIF拥有它的全部股份。现在PIF保留51%。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 825, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 25.525, "size_bytes": 154080, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 72, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_a1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 25.75, "size_bytes": 155520, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 72, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 27.65, "size_bytes": 166896, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 72, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 23.825, "size_bytes": 143856, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 72, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 25.55, "size_bytes": 154224, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 72, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@535f2a4/content/data/versions/841.json", "paragraphs": ["HUMAIN is an AI company in Saudi Arabia. Before the deal, a Saudi fund called PIF owned all of it. Now PIF keeps 51%.", "Aramco will pay about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. It will also give HUMAIN some of its AI tools and equipment.", "Aramco wants to use HUMAIN's computers and AI. It plans to use AI in its factories and daily work."], "paragraphs_zh": ["HUMAIN是沙特阿拉伯的一家人工智能公司。在这笔交易之前，沙特基金PIF拥有它的全部股份。现在PIF保留51%。", "沙特阿美将支付约99亿沙特里亚尔。它还会把自己的一些AI工具和设备交给HUMAIN。", "沙特阿美想使用HUMAIN的计算机和人工智能。它计划在工厂和日常工作中使用AI。"], "body": "HUMAIN is an AI company in Saudi Arabia. Before the deal, a Saudi fund called PIF owned all of it. Now PIF keeps 51%.\n\nAramco will pay about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. It will also give HUMAIN some of its AI tools and equipment.\n\nAramco wants to use HUMAIN's computers and AI. It plans to use AI in its factories and daily work.", "body_zh": "HUMAIN是沙特阿拉伯的一家人工智能公司。在这笔交易之前，沙特基金PIF拥有它的全部股份。现在PIF保留51%。\n\n沙特阿美将支付约99亿沙特里亚尔。它还会把自己的一些AI工具和设备交给HUMAIN。\n\n沙特阿美想使用HUMAIN的计算机和人工智能。它计划在工厂和日常工作中使用AI。", "text": "HUMAIN is an AI company in Saudi Arabia. Before the deal, a Saudi fund called PIF owned all of it. Now PIF keeps 51%. Aramco will pay about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. It will also give HUMAIN some of its AI tools and equipment. Aramco wants to use HUMAIN's computers and AI. It plans to use AI in its factories and daily work.", "vocab": [{"word": "buy", "pos": "verb", "zh": "购买", "note": "过去式是 bought", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "company", "pos": "noun", "zh": "公司", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份", "note": "常用复数 shares", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pay", "pos": "verb", "zh": "支付", "note": "过去式是 paid", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "own", "pos": "verb", "zh": "拥有", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "keep", "pos": "verb", "zh": "保留", "note": "过去式是 kept", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "plan", "pos": "verb", "zh": "计划", "note": "plan to do 表示计划做某事", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tool", "pos": "noun", "zh": "工具", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-02T00:59:06.345153", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "HUMAIN", "s": 0.3, "e": 1.188, "sm": 300, "em": 1187, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "is", "s": 1.188, "e": 1.312, "sm": 1187, "em": 1312, "cs": 7, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "an", "s": 1.312, "e": 1.438, "sm": 1312, "em": 1437, "cs": 10, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "AI", "s": 1.438, "e": 1.8, "sm": 1437, "em": 1800, "cs": 13, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "company", "s": 1.8, "e": 2.25, "sm": 1800, "em": 2250, "cs": 16, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "in", "s": 2.25, "e": 2.413, "sm": 2250, "em": 2412, "cs": 24, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "